{"unit_id":"XenoPhonLau__dsh-activity-bar#card-zh","repo":"XenoPhonLau/dsh-activity-bar","commit":"c3f530171f850562a983b2b4838f188a049371f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-activity-bar 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面客户端的界面插件：它在应用框架覆盖层注册左右活动栏，把侧边栏入口转成窄图标轨，并为工作区留出实际宽度。左侧从 DSH 面板注册表读取条目，右侧读取工具引导入口；点击可打开对应面板或工具。活动栏页面提供左右独立开关，右侧面板还可拖动调整宽度并记住设置。适合希望收起侧栏、扩大对话区域并保留快捷入口的 DSH 用户。需要 DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.3 及以上和 Node.js 22.13 及以上；偏好设置保存在本机浏览器。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1396-1467","lib/client.js:1581-1653","package.json:37-48"]}
{"unit_id":"XenoPhonLau__dsh-activity-bar#card-en","repo":"XenoPhonLau/dsh-activity-bar","commit":"c3f530171f850562a983b2b4838f188a049371f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-activity-bar adds icon rails beside DSH panels, reading registered panels and tools and opening them on selection while reserving workspace width. Settings toggle each rail; the right panel can be resized, with width saved locally. Requires DSH 0.2.1-rc.3+ and Node.js 22.13+.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1396-1467","lib/client.js:1581-1653","package.json:37-48"]}
